<% content_for :title, "The OhLife.com Alternative" %>
<% content_for :description, "Looking for an OhLife replacement? Dabble Me keeps the daily email prompt and reply-to-write habit, and lets you import your OhLife entries and photos." %>

<section class="py-12 lg:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-8">
        The OhLife.com Alternative
      </h1>

      <!-- Logo transition -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-8">
        <%= image_tag "ohlifelogo.gif", alt: "OhLife", class: "h-12" %>
        <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-muted" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
        </svg>
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-primary">Dabble me<span class="text-accent">.</span></span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Replace OhLife with Dabble Me — it was built as a near-replica of OhLife that gives you the same private place to write.
      </p>

      <a href="<%= new_user_registration_path %>" class="btn btn-primary">
        Import OhLife Entries
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="card p-6">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Import OhLife / Day One / Ahhlife / Trailmix.life Entries</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Daily or Weekly Email Reminders</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Reply-to-post entries</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Search entries</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card p-6">
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">#ThrowbackThursday everyday in your inbox</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Attach images to save with your entry</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-muted">Tag your entries with hashtags</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-accent flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <a href="/#pricing" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">Plus more with Dabble Me PRO</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-primary">Why OhLife fans feel at home</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
        OhLife worked because it asked for almost nothing: an email arrived, you replied, and the entry was saved.
        Dabble Me keeps that loop exactly as it was. A “How was your day?” email lands in your inbox, your reply becomes
        that day’s private entry, and there is no app to open, install, or remember.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Every prompt email also brings back one of your own past entries under “Remember this?”, so writing today is also a
        chance to run into an older day. The longer you write, the more there is to rediscover. Entries stay private: there are
        no followers, no sharing, and no public profile.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-primary">Move your OhLife archive in three steps</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-muted">
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-accent leading-none">1</span>
          <span><strong class="text-primary">Create your account and upgrade to PRO.</strong>
            Importing is a PRO feature ($4/month or $40/year). Starting free lets you look around first.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-accent leading-none">2</span>
          <span><strong class="text-primary">Paste your entries.</strong>
            Open <a href="<%= import_path('ohlife') %>" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">Entries → Import → OhLife</a>
            and paste the text from your OhLife export. Each entry starts with its date as <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>,
            followed by a blank line and then the entry text, so every day lands on the right date.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="font-serif text-2xl text-accent leading-none">3</span>
          <span><strong class="text-primary">Add your photos.</strong>
            Upload the ZIP of photos you downloaded from OhLife on the
            <a href="<%= import_path('photos') %>" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">photo importer</a>.
            Filenames like <code>img_2014-10-22-0.jpg</code> tell Dabble Me which day each photo belongs to.
            Large archives import best as smaller ZIP files (under 20 MB and 20 files each).</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <pre class="mt-6 card p-5 text-sm text-muted overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap">2014-10-02

Here's my first entry!

2014-10-03

Entry text starts two line-breaks after the date.</pre>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-subtle">
        Coming from somewhere else? Dabble Me also imports
        <a href="<%= day_one_alternative_path %>" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">Day One JSON exports</a>,
        Ahhlife, and Trailmix.life entries.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 overflow-x-auto card">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="border-b border-subtle">
          <tr>
            <th class="p-4 font-semibold text-primary">The OhLife habit</th>
            <th class="p-4 font-semibold text-primary">How it works in Dabble Me</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-subtle">
          <tr>
            <td class="p-4 font-medium text-primary">A daily prompt in your inbox</td>
            <td class="p-4 text-muted">Free accounts get a prompt every other Sunday. PRO lets you pick the days and the hour, from daily to weekly.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-4 font-medium text-primary">Reply to write</td>
            <td class="p-4 text-muted">Reply to the email from any email provider. The reply is saved as that day’s entry.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-4 font-medium text-primary">Looking back</td>
            <td class="p-4 text-muted">A past entry in every prompt email, plus calendar view, search, and #hashtags with PRO.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-4 font-medium text-primary">Photos</td>
            <td class="p-4 text-muted">Attach photos to an entry by email or on the web (PRO).</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="p-4 font-medium text-primary">Owning your writing</td>
            <td class="p-4 text-muted">Export your entries any time, on the free plan too.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-primary">Free to start, PRO for the full journal</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
        The free plan ($0, no time limit) includes email prompts every other Sunday, reply-by-email journaling, reading your entries
        online, past entries in your emails, and export. PRO ($4/month or $40/year) adds a custom email schedule, photo attachments,
        calendar view and search, tagging, the web editor, insights, importing, and an optional connector for ChatGPT and Claude.
        See the <a href="<%= subscribe_path %>" class="text-accent hover:text-primary underline">full pricing</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-primary">OhLife replacement FAQ</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">Can I import my OhLife entries for free?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted leading-relaxed">Importing requires PRO. You can start on the free plan, write by email, and upgrade when you are ready to bring your archive over.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">Will my imported entries stay private?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted leading-relaxed">Yes. Imported entries go into your private journal like any other entry. Dabble Me has no public profiles or sharing.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">Do I need to install an app?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted leading-relaxed">No. Journaling happens by replying to an email, and it works with any email provider. The website is there for browsing, searching, and importing.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">What if I want out later?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted leading-relaxed">You can export your entries at any time from your settings, on both the free and PRO plans.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="<%= new_user_registration_path %>" class="btn btn-primary">
        Get started free →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
